00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.908
I'm so glad that you're here.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.076
I tell you, I want to like

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.211
take the book out of your hands and like,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:45.645
oh, thank you.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.280
I want to read it. Cover to cover.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.815
I'll hold it right here for a second.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.650
But she's not holding book in this.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.185
How in back in this book at all.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:54.054
Tell me about it. Absolutely. Night.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.289
So Liz Cheney is painting

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.525
a scathing portrait

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.462
