00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.077
She says, quote,

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.712
Donald Trump cannot succeed alone

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.715
and they are enabling him.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:25.185
I think what's important is

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.786
