00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.321
She names names.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:31.791
The book is based on text messages,

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:35.595
emails, personal conversations, meetings.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:39.165
