00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.837
signing his name to the pieces of paper,

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:18.872
Green said,

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.875
sheepish, only to no one in particular.

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:25.879
The things we do for Orange Jesus.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.147
Well, that's the new nickname,

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.314
the Orange Jesus.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.116
Obviously talking about Donald Trump,

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.518
he's talking about Donald Trump.

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.052
So, you know, in public,

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.455
they're supporting him in private.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.956
This is you're hearing

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:37.857
what they really say.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:38.558
You know, in a way,

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:40.493
we suspected a new part of that

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:41.828
