00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.762
He behind the scenes

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:43.763
would talk about something

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:44.864
and then in front of the cameras.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:45.932
But there's also this moment

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:47.467
that I think everyone wondered about,

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.468
and that was

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:49.736
when former speaker

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.436
Kevin McCarthy,

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:51.804
who was hoping to become

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:52.805
the speaker of the House.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.108
Obviously, it was a short lived venture,

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:57.177
