00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:04.751
Here's the picture we're talking about.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:05.552
What did she say?

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:06.553
So first of all,

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:08.488
when she saw that picture,

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:09.656
she thought it was a fake.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:10.723
She couldn't believe it.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.325
This is just three weeks

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.093
after January 6th,

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:16.996
and he secretly goes down to Mar a Lago.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.831
And when he comes back,

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.366
she confronts him.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.268
And this is the conversation

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:23.870
that they have.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.539
Cheney says,

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:27.140
sorry.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.608
Let me get it here.

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:29.943
Mar a Lago.

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.711
What the hell, Kevin?

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:32.612
Kevin McCarthy

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.747
says they're really worried.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.716
Trump's not eating,

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:38.985
so they asked me to come see him.

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:40.720
Cheney. What?

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.155
You went to Mar a Lago

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.457
because Trump's not eating.

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:45.625
McCarthy.

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:48.628
Yeah, he's really depressed.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:52.298
I seriously, Jamie, I mean, I

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:53.700
you really can't script this.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.068
If this had been an actual show,

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.069
it would have jumped the shark,

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.470
as I say, a long time ago.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.204
That's what

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:00.240
let me let me bring in here for a second

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.741
and think about this moment

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:02.742
for we bring in the former

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.676
