00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.112
who lived this and saw this.

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:08.081
Is that seriously what his motivation

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.816
was for going down tomorrow?

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:10.550
No, no,

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.551
he was going

00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:13.419
because in the three weeks

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:16.623
between January six, when for 15 minutes,

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:17.657
the Republicans

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:18.992
all said the right thing,

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:21.694
They condemned the January 6th attack.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:24.330
They said Trump was responsible.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.032
All of a sudden,

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:28.768
Kevin McCarthy can't raise money anymore.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.637
Kevin McCarthy wants

00:04:30.637 --> 00:04:31.971
to be speaker of the House.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.373
And I'm sure

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:34.540
Congressman Kinzinger

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.743
can speak to this much better than I do.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:39.512
