00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:13.246
I mean, it's zero

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:14.681
surprise on any of this.

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:16.049
Like, I mean,

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:17.350
so you asked me, was it worth it?

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.652
Well, if you have no how do I say this?

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:20.853
Like somewhat professional.

00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:22.722
