00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:28.628
which is Kevin McCarthy, then yeah,

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:29.329
it was worth it

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:30.496
because he became speaker

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:31.364
