00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:53.986
You've got to be

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:56.389
I am too visual for that. Please.

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:58.691
I'm too visual for that right now.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:00.693
