00:08:45.892 --> 00:08:47.660
but a lot of money comes into this.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:48.361
But I want to ask you

00:08:48.361 --> 00:08:49.962
about the name of the title of the book.

00:08:49.962 --> 00:08:51.664
It's called Oath and Honor.

00:08:51.664 --> 00:08:52.832
And I am going to steal this from you.

00:08:52.832 --> 00:08:53.799
I'm not giving it back.

00:08:53.799 --> 00:08:54.867
Sorry about that.

00:08:54.867 --> 00:08:57.003
It's a memoir and a warning

00:08:57.003 --> 00:08:58.404
and I don't spoil it for me

00:08:58.404 --> 00:08:59.105
or the audience,

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:01.541
but what's the nature of the warning?

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:01.774
Look,

00:09:01.774 --> 00:09:04.510
I think this is taking Liz

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.112
Cheney has said

00:09:06.112 --> 00:09:07.280
that Donald Trump

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.181
is the most dangerous person

00:09:09.181 --> 00:09:11.717
to have ever been in the Oval Office.

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.586
And she concludes the book,

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:14.954
and I'm not giving it away.

00:09:14.954 --> 00:09:15.621
There's more.

00:09:15.621 --> 00:09:19.258
But with really this chilling warning,

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:20.526
and that is

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:21.794
that if he's allowed

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:23.563
to be president again,

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:26.399
the checks and balances of our country

00:09:26.399 --> 00:09:27.800
will not hold this

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.401
time, that

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:31.070
there will not be any guardrails.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.105
And it's really a call to action,

00:09:33.105 --> 00:09:34.740
not just Republicans,

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.309
Democrats, independents

00:09:36.309 --> 00:09:40.046
and Republicans to come together

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:42.915
and make sure he's never president again.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:44.250
Well, I may flip through the pages

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.618
and figure out Adam Kinzinger,

00:09:45.618 --> 00:09:46.352
Jamie Gangel,

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:47.887
to see if there's an announcement

00:09:47.887 --> 00:09:48.788
from the former

00:09:48.788 --> 00:09:49.722
congresswoman, Liz Cheney.

00:09:49.722 --> 00:09:50.756
I'm not saying it's in there,

00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:52.291
but I'm curious to see if

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.793
maybe she has somebody else in mind

00:09:53.793 --> 00:09:54.727
that she'd like to run

00:09:54.727 --> 00:09:57.096
and if it has her own last name.

00:09:57.096 --> 00:09:58.164
Thank you, both of you,

00:09:58.164 --> 00:09:59.131
for joining me tonight.

